WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.941
The script walks up to the placement surface.

00:00:02.941 --> 00:00:03.904
The script places a cyan wool block.

00:00:03.904 --> 00:00:05.021
Intervene is available at the checkpoint.

00:00:05.021 --> 00:00:05.804
The script pauses and touch controls appear.

00:00:05.804 --> 00:00:07.179
The touch stick moves the bot.

00:00:07.179 --> 00:00:08.306
A swipe turns the camera.

00:00:08.306 --> 00:00:09.037
11 cyan wool blocks remain.

00:00:09.037 --> 00:00:10.362
Pause shows Resume script.

00:00:10.362 --> 00:00:12.450
Manual control ends and the script keeps walking.
